	(text "CC1120/25 uning XTAL: do not mount: U1, C3, C9, R9, R6\nCC1120/25 using TCXO: do not mount: R10, R9, C10, U3, C11: mount 0 Ohm resisitor\n X1: CC1120:32MHz and CC1125:40MHz\n R10 is a 0ohms shunt resistor that ground\n the EXT_XOSC pin when TCXO is not mounted.\n  "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
